{"seq":2,"slug":"return-center-capacity-address","title":"退货中心产能与地址切换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-return-address-registry/return-address-ops/return-center-capacity-address","wordCount":2746,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"退货中心产能与地址切换\">退货中心产能与地址切换</h1><p>退货收件点与正向发货仓一样有处理上限。旺季、促销后的退货潮、或者一个合作方临时停摆，都会让某个收件点的处理能力饱和。饱和的结果不是排队，而是<strong>包裹在收货口被拒收</strong>——承运商把货拉走，注册为无人认领，几周后销毁。这个损失比排队严重得多，因为它不可逆。</p>\n<p>这一篇讲的是：如何提前发现产能饱和，把流量的地址切换做对，以及切换过程中在途包裹怎么保护。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-产能的三个约束层次\">核心概念：产能的三个约束层次</h2><h3 id=\"收货能力-处理能力与出库能力\">收货能力、处理能力与出库能力</h3><p>收件点的产能不是单一数字，而是三段串联的能力，任何一段饱和都会导致整体拒收。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>约束</th>\n<th>饱和表现</th>\n<th>典型瓶颈期</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>收货能力</td>\n<td>收货口数量、卸货时段、承运商上门频次</td>\n<td>卡车排队、拒收</td>\n<td>每日高峰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>处理能力</td>\n<td>开箱工位、质检人力、分拣线</td>\n<td>包裹积压、处理延迟</td>\n<td>促销后 1-3 周</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>出库能力</td>\n<td>再上架速度、转运班次、销毁排期</td>\n<td>仓储面积耗尽</td>\n<td>持续积压时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三段的关系决定了「饱和」这个词在系统里的正确表示方式：<strong>不能用一个占用率字段表达</strong>。真正需要监控的是三段各自的水位，以及它们之间的传导关系。处理能力饱和会先表现为积压量上升（收货还在继续），然后才表现为收货拒收。因此在处理能力上看水位，比在收货能力上等拒收要早得多。</p>\n<h3 id=\"在途与库存的区分\">在途与库存的区分</h3><p>一个容易混淆的概念：收件点的「在途量」是已经生成退货标签、正在寄往该点的包裹；「库存量」是已签收等待处理的包裹。两者的和才构成对处理能力的压力，但它们的可干预性完全不同——在途量可以通过改址或改路干预，库存量只能通过加速处理或转运来消化。</p>\n<p>这个区分决定了容量管理的两个不同动作：<strong>前置分流</strong>作用于在途量（在包裹还在路上时就把它引向别处），<strong>后置转运</strong>作用于库存量（把已经到达的包裹转走）。前置分流的成本低得多，因为它不需要二次搬运。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[退货单生成] --&gt; B[在途量累加]&#10;  B --&gt; C[到达收件点]&#10;  C --&gt; D[库存量累加]&#10;  D --&gt; E[处理]&#10;  E --&gt; F[库存量减少]&#10;  B -.水位监控.-&gt; G{处理能力水位}&#10;  D --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt;|&gt; 预警线| H[前置分流&lt;br/&gt;路由改向备用点]&#10;  G --&gt;|&gt; 临界线| I[后置转运&lt;br/&gt;已到达包裹转走]&#10;  H --&gt; J[备用收件点]&#10;  I --&gt; J\">graph TD\n  A[退货单生成] --&gt; B[在途量累加]\n  B --&gt; C[到达收件点]\n  C --&gt; D[库存量累加]\n  D --&gt; E[处理]\n  E --&gt; F[库存量减少]\n  B -.水位监控.-&gt; G{处理能力水位}\n  D --&gt; G\n  G --&gt;|&gt; 预警线| H[前置分流&lt;br/&gt;路由改向备用点]\n  G --&gt;|&gt; 临界线| I[后置转运&lt;br/&gt;已到达包裹转走]\n  H --&gt; J[备用收件点]\n  I --&gt; J</pre><h2 id=\"水位监控与预警\">水位监控与预警</h2><h3 id=\"在途量的计算\">在途量的计算</h3><p>在途量不能靠「已生成标签未签收」这个粗粒度查询得到，因为它会包含那些永远不会到达的包裹（买家没寄）。一个有意义的在途量应当只统计<strong>有实际交寄证据</strong>的包裹——即在承运商侧有首次扫描事件的单。跨境场景下这类事件的可对齐性依赖于统一的追踪标识：UPU 的 S10 标准为国际邮政物品定义 13 位标识符，其中第 3 至 10 位是八位流水号、最后两位是签发国的 ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 国家码（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/S10_(UPU_standard)\">S10 (UPU standard)</a>）。用这个标识而不是承运商本地追踪号做关联，能让跨境段与目的国段的扫描事件归并到同一条退货单上。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE VIEW v_point_inflight AS&#10;SELECT&#10;  r.point_id_snapshot AS point_id,&#10;  count(*) FILTER (WHERE t.first_scan_at IS NOT NULL) AS inflight_confirmed,&#10;  count(*) FILTER (WHERE t.first_scan_at IS NULL&#10;                     AND r.created_at &gt; now() - interval &#39;20 days&#39;) AS issued_not_shipped&#10;FROM return_order r&#10;LEFT JOIN LATERAL (&#10;  SELECT min(e.scanned_at) AS first_scan_at&#10;  FROM tracking_event e&#10;  WHERE e.tracking_no = r.tracking_no&#10;    AND e.event_code = &#39;accepted&#39;&#10;) t ON true&#10;WHERE r.status IN (&#39;label_generated&#39;, &#39;in_transit&#39;)&#10;GROUP BY 1;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VIEW</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> v_point_inflight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">point_id_snapshot</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> point_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">first_scan_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inflight_confirmed,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">first_scan_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                     AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">created_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'20 days'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> issued_not_shipped</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> return_order r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LATERAL (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">scanned_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> first_scan_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tracking_event e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tracking_no</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tracking_no</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">event_code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'accepted'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'label_generated'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'in_transit'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>把 <code>issued_not_shipped</code> 与 <code>inflight_confirmed</code> 分开统计是一个务实的细节：前者是一个虚高的预测值，因为一部分标签永远不会被使用。用它来做容量规划会导致过度保守的分流。</p>\n<h3 id=\"预警线由处理速率推导\">预警线由处理速率推导</h3><p>预警线不应是拍脑袋的绝对数，而应当由处理速率推导：如果收件点的日处理能力是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 件/天，在途包裹的平均剩余运输时间是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 天，那么在这 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 天里将到达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\cdot T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 件（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 为当前日均到达量），而同时能处理掉 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P \\cdot T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 件。积压将在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A &gt; P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 时发生。</p>\n<p>因此预警线的判据是<strong>到达速率与处理速率的关系</strong>，而不是一个容量比例：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>LoadFactor</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>arriving</mtext></msub><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>capacity</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{LoadFactor} = \\frac{A_{\\text{arriving}}}{P_{\\text{capacity}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LoadFactor</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">capacity</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">arriving</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>LoadFactor</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{LoadFactor} &gt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LoadFactor</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 且持续超过一个运输周期时，积压必然发生，此时应当启动前置分流。这个表达比「占用率达到 80% 就告警」更准确，因为占用率无法区分「到得快处理得也快」和「到得快但处理慢」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分级水位与动作\">分级水位与动作</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>水位</th>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n<th>可逆性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>正常</td>\n<td>LoadFactor &lt; 0.85</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关注</td>\n<td>0.85 ≤ LF &lt; 1.0 持续 3 天</td>\n<td>通知处理商增加人力</td>\n<td>完全可逆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预警</td>\n<td>LF ≥ 1.0 持续 5 天</td>\n<td>启动前置分流至备用点</td>\n<td>可逆，切回有成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>临界</td>\n<td>已出现拒收事件</td>\n<td>强制分流 + 后置转运</td>\n<td>部分不可逆</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「关注」这一级的作用是给人留出反应时间：多数情况下处理商可以临时加人提高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>，这是最便宜的解决方案。只有当扩人不可行时才启动分流——因为分流意味着两个收件点都达不到规模效应，单位成本上升。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分流切换的实现\">分流切换的实现</h2><h3 id=\"备用点的选择\">备用点的选择</h3><p>备用收件点不是「任何一个其他点」，它需要满足与主点相同的能力要求（同市场、同品类、同重量上限），否则分流过去的包裹会因能力不匹配再次被拒收。因此备用点的选择就是第三章路由中的候选过滤，只是把硬过滤的结果取前几名作为备用池。</p>\n<p>备用池应当在正常时期就预先确定并验证，而不是在饱和发生时临时计算。原因是临时计算可能返回空集（如果某个市场只有一个收件点），而这时候再找方案已经太晚。这个「不可为空」的约束与<a href=\"../return-route-assign/return-address-by-goods-market\">按商品类型与市场分配退货地</a>中兜底链末端的人工队列是同一套思想：任何依赖外部可用性的路径都必须有一个不依赖它的出口。</p>\n<h3 id=\"切换的粒度\">切换的粒度</h3><p>分流可以按多个粒度实施，粒度越细越平滑但越复杂。</p>\n<p><strong>全量切换</strong>是把该点的所有新单改向备用点，简单但会产生两个问题：备用点可能迅速饱和（把问题搬了个地方），以及切换后的归因混乱（同一批包裹分散在两个点，统计口径变化）。<strong>按比例切换</strong>是把一定比例的新单改向备用点，代价是路由决策需要引入比例因子，而比例因子会破坏第三章中「排序稳定」的原则。<strong>按维度切换</strong>（例如只切某个商品类别或某个目的国的退货）粒度合适，且与监控的维度对齐，是可操作性最好的选择。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE route_override&#10;SET&#10;  override_type = &#39;point_shift&#39;,&#10;  from_point_id = :saturated_point,&#10;  to_point_ids  = :standby_pool,&#10;  scope         = &#39;{&quot;market&quot;:&quot;NL&quot;,&quot;goods_classes&quot;:[&quot;general&quot;,&quot;apparel&quot;]}&#39;,&#10;  effective_from = now(),&#10;  effective_to   = NULL,&#10;  activated_by   = :operator,&#10;  reason_code    = &#39;capacity_saturation&#39;&#10;WHERE override_id = :oid;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> route_override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  override_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'point_shift'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  from_point_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :saturated_point,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  to_point_ids  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :standby_pool,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  scope         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{\"market\":\"NL\",\"goods_classes\":[\"general\",\"apparel\"]}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_from </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_to   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  activated_by   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :operator,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reason_code    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'capacity_saturation'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> override_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">oid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>scope</code> 字段是这套机制的核心：它让切换只作用于满足条件的退货单，从而保留其余流量的原有路由。<code>effective_to</code> 留空表示这是一个需要人工关闭的临时状态——这与第一章的地址状态机不同，因为容量饱和是临时事件，不需要走完整的地址生命周期。</p>\n<h3 id=\"切换必须可观测\">切换必须可观测</h3><p>一次分流切换会改变路由结果，从而改变妥投率、成本、时效的全部基线。因此切换本身必须是一个被记录、被展示的事件：切换前后的路由分布、备用点的水位变化、以及成本变化。</p>\n<p>没有这个可观测性会出现一种典型的失败模式：分流开启后忘记关闭，半年后有人发现某个市场的所有退货都在一个更贵的收件点处理，而没人知道为什么。因此临时 override 需要有到期提醒，且提醒的接收人应当是当初激活它的角色，而不是一个泛化的团队邮箱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在途与库存的保护\">在途与库存的保护</h2><h3 id=\"前置分流只影响新单\">前置分流只影响新单</h3><p>前置分流是修改路由规则，它只作用于<strong>尚未生成标签</strong>的退货单。已经生成标签的包裹已经在按旧地址运输，改路由对它们无效。这是前置分流的边界，也是最容易被误解的一点——有人认为改了规则，在途的货就会自动转向，实际上不会。</p>\n<p>因此在途量需要单独管理。可用的手段有两个：一是联系买家改投（成本高，只适合高价值件），二是与收件点协商一个过渡安排（例如允许旧地址的包裹继续送达但延长处理时限）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"库存转运的启动条件\">库存转运的启动条件</h3><p>当库存量已经超过收件点的处理能力且短期内无法消化时，需要后置转运——把已到达的包裹转移到另一个点。后置转运的成本远高于前置分流，因为它涉及二次搬运与重新登记，因此它的启动条件应当严格：只有在库存水位持续超过临界线、且处理商明确无法在承诺时限内消化时才启动。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"stock_transfer_trigger:&#10;  point_id: RP-DE-FRA-001&#10;  conditions:&#10;    stock_units_over: 8000&#10;    sustained_days: 10&#10;    processor_capacity_commitment_breached: true&#10;  transfer_target: RP-DE-FRA-002&#10;  transfer_mode: palletized&#10;  batch_size: 2000&#10;  notify: [reverse_ops, finance]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">stock_transfer_trigger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  point_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">RP-DE-FRA-001</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  conditions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    stock_units_over</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    sustained_days</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    processor_capacity_commitment_breached</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  transfer_target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">RP-DE-FRA-002</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  transfer_mode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">palletized</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  batch_size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  notify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">reverse_ops</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">finance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>sustained_days</code> 这个条件防止对短期波动做出过度反应。单日库存超标可能是到货集中，持续 10 天超标才是真正的处理能力不足。</p>\n<h3 id=\"拒收事件的不可逆性\">拒收事件的不可逆性</h3><p>一旦包裹被拒收，它就进入了承运商的无人认领流程，这个流程的退出成本极高（需要证明所有权、支付仓储费、有时还要承担销毁费）。因此<strong>拒收事件的数量应当被当作最高优先级的告警</strong>，而不是当作容量指标的一个下属数据。</p>\n<p>拒收事件还是一个值得单独记录的事实：它对应一个具体的包裹和一个具体的责任方。这个记录是后续与处理商索赔、或与承运商争议的依据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>收件点产能是收货、处理、出库三段串联，不能用单一占用率表达；处理能力饱和先表现为积压，比收货拒收早得多。</li>\n<li>在途量与库存量的可干预性不同：前置分流作用于在途（改路由只影响未生成标签的单），后置转运作用于库存。</li>\n<li>预警线由到达速率与处理速率之比 LoadFactor 推导，而非绝对容量比例；分四级水位，关注级用于给处理商留扩人时间。</li>\n<li>分流切换用带 scope 的临时 override 表达，粒度按维度（市场/品类）优于全量或按比例；备用池须预先确定并验证能力匹配。</li>\n<li>拒收事件不可逆，应当作为最高优先级告警并单独记录责任事实。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"退货中心产能与地址切换","id":"退货中心产能与地址切换"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：产能的三个约束层次","id":"核心概念-产能的三个约束层次"},{"level":3,"text":"收货能力、处理能力与出库能力","id":"收货能力-处理能力与出库能力"},{"level":3,"text":"在途与库存的区分","id":"在途与库存的区分"},{"level":2,"text":"水位监控与预警","id":"水位监控与预警"},{"level":3,"text":"在途量的计算","id":"在途量的计算"},{"level":3,"text":"预警线由处理速率推导","id":"预警线由处理速率推导"},{"level":3,"text":"分级水位与动作","id":"分级水位与动作"},{"level":2,"text":"分流切换的实现","id":"分流切换的实现"},{"level":3,"text":"备用点的选择","id":"备用点的选择"},{"level":3,"text":"切换的粒度","id":"切换的粒度"},{"level":3,"text":"切换必须可观测","id":"切换必须可观测"},{"level":2,"text":"在途与库存的保护","id":"在途与库存的保护"},{"level":3,"text":"前置分流只影响新单","id":"前置分流只影响新单"},{"level":3,"text":"库存转运的启动条件","id":"库存转运的启动条件"},{"level":3,"text":"拒收事件的不可逆性","id":"拒收事件的不可逆性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"退货妥投与地址准确率监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-return-address-registry/return-address-ops/return-address-accuracy-monitor"},"next":{"title":"退货地址变更审计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-return-address-registry/return-address-ops/return-address-audit"}}